---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { site } from '../config/site';
---
<Base title={`Privacy Policy | ${site.name}`} description={`How ${site.name} handles the details you share with us.`}>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container"><h1>Privacy Policy</h1><p>Last updated: October 2026</p></div>
  </section>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container prose">
      <p>This policy explains what {site.name} ("we") collects through this website and how we use it, in line with India's Digital Personal Data Protection Act, 2023.</p>
      <h2>What we collect</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Details you type into the enquiry form: name, phone, email, the service you need, budget and your message.</li>
        <li>Details you give the chat assistant when you ask for a call-back: name, phone and the service you need. The chat assistant is automated (not AI); your other chat messages stay in your browser and are not saved or sent to us.</li>
        <li>Basic technical data your browser sends (such as device type), used only to keep the site working.</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>Why we use it</h2>
      <p>Only to reply to your enquiry, prepare a quote and stay in touch about your project. We do not sell or rent your details.</p>
      <h2>Who processes it</h2>
      <p>The enquiry form and chat call-back requests are delivered to our email through Web3Forms, a form-to-email service. Our website is hosted on a cloud provider. These services handle data only to provide their service to us.</p>
      <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
      <p>Enquiries that do not become projects are deleted within 12 months. Client records are kept as long as needed for the project and for legal or tax reasons.</p>
      <h2>Your rights</h2>
      <p>You can ask us to see, correct or delete your details, or withdraw consent, by writing to <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>. We reply within 30 days.</p>
      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>{site.name}, {site.address}. Phone: <a href={site.phoneHref}>{site.phone}</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
